sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin app
    participant API
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FCM as Firebase

    Admin->>API: POST /files/upload-batch/{reasoningId} (multipart)
    loop each file
        API->>R2: put object
        API->>DB: insert study_files row
    end
    API->>FCM: one "new files" push to the topic
    API-->>Admin: created files
